  "id": "ENSVF3C11",
  "name": "5_narrow_vs_wide_transformation",
  "paragraphs": [
    {
      "text": "%spark\nval fileRdd = spark.sparkContext.textFile(\"/FileStore/tables/suankiData/raw/emp.csv\")\n\nval splittedRdd = fileRdd.map(x => x.split(\",\")).filter(x => x(0) != \"EMPLOYEE_ID\")\nsplittedRdd.take(1)",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "361f9be1daf94d31a7286"
    },
    {
      "text": "%spark\ndef calculateReportCardStatistics(rdd : RDD[(String, String)]\n): RDD[(String, ReportCardMetrics)] ={\n      rdd.aggregateByKey(new MetricsCalculator(totalWords = 0,\n      longestWord = 0, happyMentions = 0, numberReportCards = 0))(\n      seqOp = ((reportCardMetrics, reportCardText) =>\n      reportCardMetrics.sequenceOp(reportCardText)),\n      combOp = (x, y) => x.compOp(y))\n      .mapValues(_.toReportCardMetrics)\n}",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/scala",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "scala",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "0edfb7bf5fed4a4387935"
    },
    {
      "text": "####Minimizing Object Creation\n\n\n- We can reduce the size and number of our objects by **reusing existing\nobjects** and by using data structures (such as primitive types) that take up less space in memory.",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
        }
      },
      "settings": {
        "params": {},
        "forms": {}
      },
      "id": "50cd72c76771455ca5f2b"
    },
    {
      "text": "\n#### Implications for Fault Tolerance\n\n- cost of recomputing a partition\n- suggested to checkpointing rdd or cache df",
      "config": {
        "colWidth": 12,
        "fontSize": 9,
        "enabled": true,
        "editorMode": "ace/mode/markdown",
        "editorSetting": {
          "params": {},
          "forms": {},
          "language": "markdown",
          "editOnDblClick": false,
          "completionKey": "TAB",
          "completionSupport": true
